  "question": "Where\u2019s the closest fast food restaurant you hit on the way to Maritime Museum at Battery Wharf, Boston, MA from Copicut Woods Parking, Westport, MA?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-71.065023 41.708865)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-71.051156 42.367038)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'fast_food'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-71.065023 41.708865)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-71.065023 41.708865)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
